WEBVTT

00:00:03.390 --> 00:00:08.190
Ever since I was a child,
there was nothing that I couldn't accomplish.

00:00:09.020 --> 00:00:09.940
That was why...

00:00:11.030 --> 00:00:14.820
I could never relate to
my thick-skulled elder brothers,

00:00:14.820 --> 00:00:17.160
or even my parents.

00:00:19.620 --> 00:00:24.330
At the Albion Military Academy,
I didn't find it any different,

00:00:24.330 --> 00:00:26.130
and my days lacked any spark.

00:00:27.380 --> 00:00:32.380
But then, everything changed
the moment I met you.

00:01:05.290 --> 00:01:07.040
Hey, you're not hurt, are you?

00:01:08.670 --> 00:01:09.790
Uh, no.

00:03:16.170 --> 00:03:17.380
Thank you very much!

00:03:23.840 --> 00:03:25.390
E-Excuse me!

00:03:26.390 --> 00:03:28.810
Are you that girl from the other day?

00:03:30.770 --> 00:03:33.900
Did you make these yourself?

00:03:33.900 --> 00:03:35.810
This is my thanks to you for saving me.

00:03:35.810 --> 00:03:37.900
I just hope they're to your liking.

00:03:37.900 --> 00:03:39.030
Thanks.

00:03:39.030 --> 00:03:40.820
Don't mind if I do.

00:03:46.080 --> 00:03:47.990
Mm, this is good!

00:03:47.990 --> 00:03:49.660
Y-You really think so?

00:04:35.250 --> 00:04:37.960
Vira, I think you've outdone yourself yet again.

00:04:40.880 --> 00:04:42.970
You know, I'll be graduating soon.

00:04:45.840 --> 00:04:46.840
Katalina...

00:04:48.390 --> 00:04:50.640
My dream will finally come true.

00:04:50.640 --> 00:04:53.390
To become a great knight
and protect the people.

00:04:54.060 --> 00:04:57.150
It's why I've spent all this time
honing my skills.

00:04:58.610 --> 00:05:00.900
You'll see your dream to fruition.

00:05:02.780 --> 00:05:04.280
So help me, you will.

00:05:12.240 --> 00:05:16.420
Are you telling me to live not as a knight,
but as Lord Commander?

00:05:17.330 --> 00:05:20.750
I've undergone all this training
in order to become a knight—

00:05:20.750 --> 00:05:25.050
This is a great honor, Katalina.

00:05:25.050 --> 00:05:27.340
We all have high hopes for you.

00:05:33.680 --> 00:05:36.310
As it stands now, in all of Albion,

00:05:36.310 --> 00:05:39.940
the only one who might have
the slightest chance of defeating Katalina...

00:05:40.610 --> 00:05:42.070
...is me.

00:05:48.990 --> 00:05:50.530
I'm the only one...

00:05:51.780 --> 00:05:55.910
...who can set her free!

00:05:59.630 --> 00:06:02.550
And the winner is Vira Lillie!

00:06:24.440 --> 00:06:25.280
Katalina...

00:06:29.360 --> 00:06:31.160
Go and do as you please.

00:06:33.080 --> 00:06:33.910
Vira...

00:07:25.380 --> 00:07:28.460
<i>But what about Lyria?
What about her?</i>

00:07:33.930 --> 00:07:34.930
Katalina!

00:07:35.680 --> 00:07:39.560
Before the ritual starts,
would you like something to eat?

00:07:41.980 --> 00:07:43.100
These are...

00:07:43.600 --> 00:07:46.480
I hoped to have you eat them again one day,

00:07:46.480 --> 00:07:48.730
so I've been perfecting my technique
this whole time.

00:07:48.730 --> 00:07:51.490
In addition to your duties as Lord Commander?

00:07:51.490 --> 00:07:53.450
You must've been very busy.

00:07:53.990 --> 00:07:56.160
It was nothing, really.

00:07:56.910 --> 00:08:01.080
Besides, it seems you've had
your share of troubles, too.

00:08:01.870 --> 00:08:04.000
You were pronounced a fugitive so suddenly...

00:08:04.250 --> 00:08:06.670
When I first heard about it,
I thought it was a mistake.

00:08:06.670 --> 00:08:08.340
I couldn't believe my ears.

00:08:08.340 --> 00:08:11.630
I guess I made you worry.
Sorry about that.

00:08:12.090 --> 00:08:15.220
No, please don't concern yourself with me.

00:08:16.260 --> 00:08:20.180
It's just that when I think about
your dream being shattered...

00:08:20.600 --> 00:08:23.100
My dream?

00:08:23.600 --> 00:08:27.690
Your dream was to become
a great knight, remember?

00:08:27.690 --> 00:08:30.480
Oh, right. I suppose so.

00:08:31.610 --> 00:08:35.610
Actually, ever since I've found myself
on the run from the Empire,

00:08:35.610 --> 00:08:39.370
I feel as if I've finally become a true knight.

00:08:41.450 --> 00:08:45.040
You don't need a master or a country
to protect people.

00:08:46.290 --> 00:08:48.880
The moment you wield your sword
for someone else's sake,

00:08:48.880 --> 00:08:51.170
that's when you can truly
call yourself a knight.

00:09:00.810 --> 00:09:02.930
Mm, this is good!

00:09:02.930 --> 00:09:06.520
I'm sure these are the best sandwiches
in all the skies!

00:09:09.400 --> 00:09:11.860
I wish I could've shared them
with the others, too.

00:09:16.780 --> 00:09:20.330
I knew those skyfarers would come between us.

00:09:21.200 --> 00:09:24.410
That runt of a general!
What's taking him so long?

00:09:27.000 --> 00:09:32.710
General Furias, that crew is here,
requesting an audience with you.

00:09:34.170 --> 00:09:36.510
Ah, you're in my way!
Move it!

00:09:37.550 --> 00:09:39.010
Hey, you jerks!

00:09:39.010 --> 00:09:41.390
You've got a lot of nerve,
deceiving us like that!

00:09:41.640 --> 00:09:43.270
Full pardon, my foot!

00:09:43.270 --> 00:09:45.520
Turns out there's a catch behind it all!

00:09:45.520 --> 00:09:50.270
Using our freedom as bargaining chip,
forcing them to let you use Luminiera as a weapon!

00:09:50.270 --> 00:09:52.530
We never heard anything about such a term!

00:09:53.110 --> 00:09:54.820
Luminiera?

00:09:54.820 --> 00:09:58.660
Ah, so that's the pretext
the Lord Commander came up with.

00:10:00.490 --> 00:10:04.120
<i>And? What are you guys gonna do about it?</i>

00:10:04.120 --> 00:10:06.410
We can't let Katalina sacrifice herself!

00:10:06.410 --> 00:10:08.960
When we go free, she has to come with us!

00:10:09.580 --> 00:10:12.000
We weren't informed of all your terms!

00:10:12.590 --> 00:10:14.090
Therefore the agreement is void!

00:10:15.010 --> 00:10:17.130
If it comes down to losing Katalina,

00:10:17.130 --> 00:10:20.260
we would rather fight for our freedom instead!

00:10:22.720 --> 00:10:24.060
That's all we have to say!

00:10:25.470 --> 00:10:26.640
Come back here!

00:10:26.640 --> 00:10:27.770
- Halt!
- Hey!

00:10:33.900 --> 00:10:35.230
Fire! Fire!

00:10:38.030 --> 00:10:39.030
Wh-What's this?

00:10:41.740 --> 00:10:43.200
Let's go to Katalina!

00:10:46.370 --> 00:10:48.210
Don't let them escape!
All units, attack—

00:10:49.080 --> 00:10:52.590
Hey, who said you could give out orders?

00:10:52.590 --> 00:10:58.090
But if we let them get away,
the prestige of the Erste Empire...

00:10:58.090 --> 00:11:00.890
Prestige? Who gives a crap?

00:11:00.890 --> 00:11:02.680
The real fun starts now.

00:11:03.930 --> 00:11:06.100
Just wait and see.

00:11:10.640 --> 00:11:15.440
Apostle from the stars...
Beast who acts as guardian of knights...

00:11:16.230 --> 00:11:20.030
Imbue our hands with thy radiance...
Imbue our swords with thy power...

00:11:20.700 --> 00:11:24.950
Imbue our people with thy prayers...
Lift our hopes, unto the guardian's blade...

00:11:25.910 --> 00:11:30.040
Through this pact, we beseech you...
Release your light.

00:11:29.210 --> 00:11:30.540
Katalina!

00:11:30.540 --> 00:11:31.370
Katalina!

00:11:31.960 --> 00:11:33.290
Lyria! Gran!

00:11:33.290 --> 00:11:34.080
Vyrn!

00:11:34.710 --> 00:11:35.590
What are you...

00:11:37.300 --> 00:11:38.130
Gran!

00:11:38.630 --> 00:11:40.340
You people, again?

00:11:41.130 --> 00:11:45.760
Katalina is about to become
Luminiera's master for your sake.

00:11:45.760 --> 00:11:48.640
Are you going to let her kindness go to waste?

00:11:48.640 --> 00:11:51.810
That's right. This way, you can all be free.

00:11:52.310 --> 00:11:54.400
You don't have to worry about—

00:11:53.400 --> 00:11:54.900
The deal with the empire!

00:11:55.650 --> 00:11:57.400
We just called it off!

00:11:57.400 --> 00:11:58.440
What?

00:11:58.440 --> 00:12:03.160
There's no need for you to do this!

00:12:05.950 --> 00:12:09.580
Luminiera's reassignment ritual
has already begun.

00:12:09.580 --> 00:12:12.160
At this point, no one could possibly stop it.

00:12:12.160 --> 00:12:16.670
Does that mean Katalina
won't be able to leave the island?

00:12:17.920 --> 00:12:19.920
Now, let's continue.

00:12:21.840 --> 00:12:22.680
Katalina!

00:12:23.380 --> 00:12:27.810
Do you really think Lyria would sacrifice you?
That she could just move on?

00:12:29.970 --> 00:12:35.770
Would this really make Lyria,
or even Vira, truly happy?

00:12:38.110 --> 00:12:38.940
Katalina!

00:12:52.710 --> 00:12:54.790
Stop it, Lyria! It's too dangerous!

00:13:09.470 --> 00:13:10.810
Hey...

00:13:10.810 --> 00:13:13.180
Do you remember, Katalina?

00:13:14.310 --> 00:13:18.690
<i>When showed me the real sky
for the first time?</i>

00:13:27.110 --> 00:13:29.990
What do you think?
The skies are vast, aren't they?

00:13:31.950 --> 00:13:34.250
Where is this breeze coming from?

00:13:36.250 --> 00:13:40.540
Somewhere far away, that we can't see from here.

00:13:40.540 --> 00:13:45.670
The world spreads out infinitely,
beyond even the end of the skies.

00:13:48.640 --> 00:13:51.720
Someday, will you show that to me, too?

00:13:53.680 --> 00:13:54.810
Sure.

00:13:55.600 --> 00:13:57.770
And that's a promise, Lyria.

00:14:02.610 --> 00:14:07.530
Katalina, do you really want
to become Luminiera's master?

00:14:08.700 --> 00:14:10.820
Do you want to stay in Albion forever?

00:14:12.910 --> 00:14:15.040
If you really do feel that way,

00:14:15.500 --> 00:14:17.870
if that will make you happy,

00:14:18.790 --> 00:14:20.880
I'll be sad, but I won't stop you.

00:14:22.130 --> 00:14:27.010
But... but if that's not the case,

00:14:27.010 --> 00:14:29.930
then I'll lead you this time!

00:14:30.340 --> 00:14:35.310
Just like you led me to the vast, blue skies!

00:14:44.650 --> 00:14:47.900
Please, Katalina! Tell us what you truly want!

00:14:47.900 --> 00:14:49.780
Please, Katalina!

00:14:52.490 --> 00:14:57.290
We want to continue our journey
with you by our side!

00:14:59.420 --> 00:15:01.790
If we sacrificed someone we cherished,
just to carry on...

00:15:03.290 --> 00:15:05.300
How could we ever be happy?!

00:15:10.340 --> 00:15:11.510
Lyria! Gran!

00:15:13.600 --> 00:15:14.430
Katalina!

00:15:20.190 --> 00:15:25.320
I... could set Lyria free by giving myself up.

00:15:26.610 --> 00:15:27.570
And Vira...

00:15:29.360 --> 00:15:31.910
I could offer you atonement.

00:15:32.530 --> 00:15:34.070
That's what I thought.

00:15:34.580 --> 00:15:38.700
But just as Gran said,
even if I did such a thing,

00:15:39.960 --> 00:15:44.080
even if it's at my expense,
it won't lead to anyone else's happiness.

00:15:45.040 --> 00:15:46.550
I knew that, and yet...

00:15:48.460 --> 00:15:51.930
I ended up making
the same mistake again, huh?

00:15:52.930 --> 00:15:54.180
Katalina...

00:16:23.210 --> 00:16:27.040
Hey, what was that just now?
What's going on in there?

00:16:27.420 --> 00:16:29.920
Dammit! Now we can't get back!

00:16:31.010 --> 00:16:33.930
Disabling the final safety. Charging power!

00:16:34.470 --> 00:16:37.850
60... 70... 85!

00:16:39.350 --> 00:16:41.600
This is what I've been waiting for!

00:16:41.600 --> 00:16:44.060
She finally snapped!

00:16:44.560 --> 00:16:46.360
Don't let anyone thwart us!

00:16:47.730 --> 00:16:49.440
I was so close...

00:16:52.190 --> 00:16:59.240
Just a little longer, and you would've spent
the rest of your life blissfully with me, here in Albion...

00:17:00.490 --> 00:17:01.830
Vira...

00:17:01.830 --> 00:17:04.620
I thought you couldn't use Luminiera's power.

00:17:04.620 --> 00:17:08.420
Luminiera was responding to Vira all along.

00:17:08.420 --> 00:17:13.800
The wall that was blocking us,
and the power just now, were Luminiera's.

00:17:13.800 --> 00:17:16.430
So it was all lies?

00:17:16.430 --> 00:17:18.890
So you could keep Katalina here?

00:17:19.680 --> 00:17:24.730
It was all...
It was all their fault, Katalina.

00:17:26.980 --> 00:17:30.520
For six years, ever since you left this island,

00:17:30.520 --> 00:17:34.820
I missed you so, so much
that I cried every night.

00:17:34.820 --> 00:17:37.200
Even so, I was able to endure it,

00:17:37.200 --> 00:17:42.080
for sacrificing myself allowed you
to realize your dream

00:17:42.080 --> 00:17:45.960
of becoming a great knight,
just as you wished.

00:17:45.960 --> 00:17:47.330
I truly believed that.

00:17:49.540 --> 00:17:54.510
But when I heard that you'd suddenly
become a fugitive from the Empire,

00:17:54.510 --> 00:17:56.010
my heart was nearly crushed.

00:17:56.720 --> 00:18:00.550
I wanted to rush to your side right away, but...

00:18:01.600 --> 00:18:04.600
As I'm bound to Luminiera,

00:18:04.600 --> 00:18:07.560
I'm not allowed to take a single step
off this island.

00:18:28.540 --> 00:18:29.670
I didn't...

00:18:31.040 --> 00:18:36.340
I didn't become Albion's Lord Commander
to turn you into a criminal!

00:18:40.140 --> 00:18:41.010
If only you...

00:18:44.220 --> 00:18:46.270
If only you people hadn't come into our lives!

00:18:48.520 --> 00:18:49.730
Take cover!

00:18:49.730 --> 00:18:50.980
Fire!

00:18:59.360 --> 00:19:02.370
Excellent! Excellent!
Better than calculated!

00:19:02.660 --> 00:19:04.910
Dammit! He actually went and did it.

00:19:04.910 --> 00:19:06.540
Hey, is everyone okay?

00:19:12.210 --> 00:19:14.210
<i>Hey there, Lord Commander!</i>

00:19:14.210 --> 00:19:17.800
<i>Did you like that present I just gave you?</i>

00:19:20.470 --> 00:19:24.310
<i>Thanks to you, Adversa's in top form!</i>

00:19:24.310 --> 00:19:30.140
<i>As promised, I will eliminate every member
of the Grandcypher's crew!</i>

00:19:30.140 --> 00:19:34.900
<i>Wait, was I supposed to spare
Lieutenant Katalina?</i>

00:19:34.900 --> 00:19:37.530
<i>Well, at this point it can't be helped, right?</i>

00:19:37.530 --> 00:19:41.490
<i>I mean, we can't just let
a deserter go unpunished!</i>

00:19:43.990 --> 00:19:47.290
<i>But good for you. You got your wish.</i>

00:19:47.290 --> 00:19:50.290
<i>Now you can have
your happily ever after with her.</i>

00:19:52.630 --> 00:19:54.420
<i>In the next life, that is!</i>

00:20:19.820 --> 00:20:21.030
A few more moments.

00:20:21.950 --> 00:20:24.950
Wait that long. That's all I ask for, Katalina.

00:20:25.830 --> 00:20:32.460
While I exterminate these pests for you.

00:22:05.670 --> 00:22:08.760
The imperial headquarters,
also known as the Tower.

00:22:09.260 --> 00:22:12.560
Who knew all this would be going on inside?

00:22:12.560 --> 00:22:13.930
Really, what a shock!

00:22:14.890 --> 00:22:18.770
What could they be making, Sturm?

00:22:18.770 --> 00:22:19.940
How should I know?

00:22:20.690 --> 00:22:22.860
But just like the Black Knight foresaw,

00:22:22.860 --> 00:22:28.910
seems that treacherous prime minister
is about to wreak havoc.

00:22:29.620 --> 00:22:30.830
I know, right?

00:22:31.490 --> 00:22:35.750
Even worse, she's doing this in secret.

00:22:35.750 --> 00:22:39.000
Takes guts to go behind
the top advisor of the Erste Empire!

00:22:39.000 --> 00:22:42.380
Oh man, you think the Black Knight will be okay?

00:22:42.380 --> 00:22:45.710
She may not look it,
but she can be pretty reckless, you know!

00:22:45.710 --> 00:22:48.970
I just hope her standing
within the empire hasn't taken a hit.

00:22:48.970 --> 00:22:50.590
Who cares about that?

00:22:50.590 --> 00:22:52.970
She's our employer.

00:22:52.970 --> 00:22:57.520
And since we've taken her money,
we'll protect her, whatever it takes.

00:22:57.520 --> 00:23:00.600
Even if we're up against the empire.
That's all there is to it.

00:23:01.520 --> 00:23:02.770
I agree!

00:23:02.770 --> 00:23:07.320
Then again, that's not the only reason
you're worried about her, is it, Sturm?

00:23:07.990 --> 00:23:10.160
Really, you're such a softie on the inside.

00:23:10.780 --> 00:23:13.830
Ouch! Hey, that hurts!

00:23:13.830 --> 00:23:15.870
Control that mouth of yours, or I'll stab you!

00:23:16.120 --> 00:23:18.460
Haven't you already stabbed me enough?

00:23:18.460 --> 00:23:20.330
Hey! Who the hell are you?

00:23:22.750 --> 00:23:25.050
Whoops! We've been found!

00:23:26.050 --> 00:23:27.210
Great timing.

00:23:27.210 --> 00:23:31.050
I was getting sick of all this tiptoeing around.

00:23:34.930 --> 00:23:39.940
EPISODE 5
KATALINA AND VIRA

00:23:36.470 --> 00:23:39.020
Next episode, "Katalina and Vira."
